text"},{"text":"defaultHeldRecordLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/defaultheldrecordlimit","abstract":[{"text":"The most records a consent holds unless it is given another bound: 1,000.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"title":"Consent","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","text":"ConsentCategory"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers13ConsentStatusO","text":"ConsentStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"heldRecordLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/init(_:heldrecordlimit:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A consent with the categories in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statuses"},{"type":"text","text":" decided, and every other undecided."}],"title":"init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"},"